[1322.903552, "o", "v4 max diff: 7.343292236328125e-05 rel to tol: 0.23888657987117767\r\ncublas fp16 (M,3K)@(3K,N): (2.0982720098997416, 2.0618879795074463)\r\nv4 cfg (128, 256, 64, 8, 8, 4): mean 2.213 min 2.208\r\nv4 cfg (128, 256, 64, 8, 8, 5): FAIL OutOfResources\r\nv4 cfg (128, 256, 64, 8, 4, 4): mean 15.994 min 15.822\r\nv4 cfg (256, 128, 64, 8, 8, 4): mean 2.342 min 2.331\r\nv4 cfg (128, 256, 32, 8, 8, 6): mean 2.304 min 2.230\r\nv4 cfg (64, 256, 64, 8, 4, 4): mean 2.612 min 2.598\r\nBEST v4: (2.2133271568699886, (128, 256, 64, 8, 8, 4))\r\n"]
