[1778.591694, "o", "v7 cfg (128, 256, 64, 8, 8, 3): FAIL OutOfResources: out of resource: shared memory, Required: 262192, Hardware limit: 232448. Reducing block sizes or `num_stages` may help.\r\nv7 cfg (128, 128, 64, 8, 8, 3): mean 3.073 min 3.048 rel 0.221\r\nv7 cfg (128, 256, 32, 8, 8, 4): mean 2.701 min 2.610 rel 0.220\r\nv7 cfg (128, 128, 32, 8, 8, 4): mean 2.486 min 2.403 rel 0.220\r\nv7 cfg (128, 128, 64, 8, 8, 4): mean 3.168 min 3.098 rel 0.221\r\nv7 cfg (256, 128, 64, 8, 8, 3): mean 2.972 min 2.881 rel 0.221\r\nBEST v7: (2.4864757813905416, (128, 128, 32, 8, 8, 4))\r\n"]
